  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Asahi Refining Usa has $464M in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Asahi Refining Usa received 122 awards in the same period, with an average award size of $3.8M. Obligations rose up 36.7% year over year. FY26 obligations were $464M compared with FY25 obligations of $340M and FY24 obligations of $355M. FY22 obligations were $153M and FY21 obligations were $368M. Current-year totals are partial (fiscal year to date). All figures reported are contract obligations except where award-value figures in tables are total contract values. This snapshot shows that obligations are concentrated in the current fiscal year and provides a clear baseline of federal procurement activity tied to Asahi Refining Usa through FY2026 to date.",
